Before submitting your work, make sure you go over the checklist and try to correct as many errors as possible by yourself. Very often, just by reviewing your own work, you can find a lot of easy-to-spot errors and bugs.

The more requirements you meet, the higher your final grade. Following performance-related requirements can earn you quite a few more points. And the more points you earn, the closer your project is to the industry standard.
